  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This standard (Part 2) covers the requirements of following categories of crosslinked polyethylene insulated and PVC sheathed or polyethylene sheathed cables for single phase or three phase (earthed or unearthed) systems for electricity supply purposes: a) Types of Cables 1) Single-core unscreened, unarmoured (but non-magnetic metallic tape covered); 2) Single-core screened, unarmoured; 3) Single-core armoured (non-magnetic) screened or unscreened; and 4) Three-core armoured, screened or unscreened. b) Voltage Grade (UJU) 1) Earthed systems: 1 .9/3.3 kV, 3.8/6.6 kV, 6.35/11 kV, 12.7/22 kV and 19/33 kV. 2) Unearthed system: 3.3/3.3kV and 1 1/1 IkV. NOTES 1 Cables of 6.35/1 IkV grade (earthed systems) are suitable for use on 6.6/6.6 kV and (unearthed system) also.",
